      "score": 88,
      "summary": "A thorough, honest audit with clear P0–P3 findings that separate source evidence from runtime hypotheses. Its hardening and accessibility coverage is broad, and it reconciles static signals well. Weaknesses: it puts polish before optimization, sets only INP/CLS budgets and leaves the filter and render budgets to be agreed later, and keeps acceptance conditions in the validation section instead of attaching them to each fix."
